  "note": "该 baseline 先行定义对齐分类器 + 弹窗短路的真实环境验收指标。首次执行需要：(1) frontend_real_runner_learning.py 补 GET /learning-units/{id} 抓取；(2) 支持 setup.env_overrides 用于 fail-open case。首次执行后回填 pass/fail、证据路径、已知 implementation_gap 与质量棘轮。",
  "must_pass_cases": [
    "lm-align-clear-input-no-popup",
    "lm-align-multi-candidate-high-cost-popup",
